{"id":"635468","name":"脆麻花","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/635468/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"30克"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"1.5克"},{"name":"无铝泡打粉","amount":"2克"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"30克"},{"name":"水","amount":"90克"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"稍宽(炸麻花用，以实际消耗为准)"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主料中所有的食材一起放入大碗中。","img":"images/635468/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌至大面絮。","img":"images/635468/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"下手揉成面团，盖上保鲜膜，室温松弛30分钟左右。","img":"images/635468/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"时间结束后，面团再次揉光滑。","img":"images/635468/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"擀成稍厚的大面片。","img":"images/635468/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切成小条状，盖上保鲜膜，以免风干。","img":"images/635468/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一根小面条，搓成40cm左右的细长条，两只手反方向对搓一下。","img":"images/635468/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"两头合并，扭成麻花辫。","img":"images/635468/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再两只手重复反方向搓一下。","img":"images/635468/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次提起扭一下。","img":"images/635468/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"尾端穿一下。","img":"images/635468/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"依次全部做完，麻花生胚就好了，盖上保鲜膜，室温松弛20分钟。","img":"images/635468/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/635468/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"油五成热时，下入麻花生胚。","img":"images/635468/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"炸至金黄色。","img":"images/635468/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"捞出，沥干油。","img":"images/635468/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/635468/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/635468/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/635468/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}